* approved role instructions;
* relevant business context;
* relevant requirements;
* relevant ADRs;
* relevant UX Contract sections;
* relevant task state;
* necessary repository excerpts;
* evidence and findings relevant to its decision.

Do not provide every agent with every prior transcript.

Do not expose private model reasoning.

Persist exact context bundles for auditability.

